## About

Penumbra Forge LLC is an independent software company building privacy-first AI and security tools. Everything here is client-side and open source. Local AI tools run a model in your browser (WebGPU) or connect to your own Ollama / LM Studio / OpenAI-compatible endpoint — your data never leaves your machine. Our flagship product Umbra, a local-first AI studio built for NVIDIA DGX Spark, is in development: https://penumbraforge.com/umbra/
